### == Installation ==

If you love all these features, let’s know how to get started with the Genie Image Generator plugin.

  

Step 1: Activate the license key.

Step 2: From the WordPress dashboard, click Media

Step 3: Locate the “Genie Image AI” button at the top.

Step 4: Clicking on it will reveal the media settings popup.

Step 5: Put your prompt in the “Context / Keyword” box from the “Genie Image” tab.

Step 6: Hit the “Generate” button and within seconds you will see the image.

Step 7: Select the generated image, you will see a “+” icon at the top right.

Step 8: Click it to save the image to the media library.

